==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Raynard]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This is a fairly simple stage. All you really have to do is treat it like a regular, easy metal stage, in which you also have to rush down a backliner.

Start by stalling the first metal enemies with regular meatshields and critical hitters, possibly the cheap and replaceable type, then summon [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to quickly kill Raynard when a surge is not active. Alternatively, summon [[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Power Cutter Cat]] when the surge is active, so he gets hit, then charges again with strengthen active to one-shot the boss. Note that Power Cutter Cat can only one shot Raynard without attack up combos at level 36+.

Another strategy is to bring starting money combos, then send [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Stone Cat]] and [[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Power Cutter Cat]] immediately at the start of the stage to instantly kill Raynard. Stone Cat triggers Raynard's attack, hitting Power Cutter Cat and killing Raynard before anything else spawns.

